{
  "title": { "zh": "同一张图，不同的世界", "en": "One image, different worlds" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "到这里，检查台默认答案就在图里。可图是由场景生成的：<wiki-ref to=\"computer-graphics\"></wiki-ref>从物体、材质、光照和相机出发，正向渲出图像；视觉走反方向，手里只有图，要说出场景是什么样。",
        "en": "So far the station has assumed the answer is in the image. But images are generated from scenes: <wiki-ref to=\"computer-graphics\"></wiki-ref> renders an image forwards from objects, materials, light and a camera; vision goes the other way, holding only the image and having to say what the scene is like."
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "这一关的问题是：只看这一张图，箱子离相机多远？题目给出这张图和几个都渲得出它的候选场景，判断关于场景的每句话：在每个候选场景里都对，才算成立；都错是不成立；有对有错就是无法确定。",
        "en": "This level asks: from this image alone, how far is the box from the camera? You get the image and several candidate scenes that all render it, and judge each statement about the scene: true in every candidate, it holds; false in every one, it does not; true in some and false in others, it is undetermined."
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "从图像推回场景是<wiki-ref to=\"inverse-problem\"></wiki-ref>：三维投成二维丢了一维，不同的场景能渲出同一张图。",
    "en": "Inferring the scene from the image is an <wiki-ref to=\"inverse-problem\"></wiki-ref>: projecting 3D to 2D loses a dimension, and different scenes can render the same image."
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "0C1",
      "kind": "choice",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "判断关于场景的每句话：成立、不成立，还是无法确定。",
        "en": "Judge each statement about the scene: holds, does not hold, or undetermined."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "箱子在图里的大小，取决于它有多大，也取决于它有多远。",
          "en": "How big the box looks in the image depends on how big it is, and also on how far away."
        }
      ],
      "judge": "claims",
      "rounds": [
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "红色箱子离相机 2 米。", "en": "The red box is 2 m from the camera." },
              "claim": { "depth": { "object": "box", "z": 2 } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "箱子是红色的。", "en": "The box is red." },
              "claim": { "colour": { "object": "box", "is": "red" } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "箱子高 0.5 米。", "en": "The box is 0.5 m tall." },
              "claim": { "height": { "object": "box", "h": 0.5 } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "箱子是蓝色的。", "en": "The box is blue." },
              "claim": { "colour": { "object": "box", "is": "blue" } }
            }
          ],
          "scenes": [
            {
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 5, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 50 },
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "box",
                  "class": "box",
                  "colour": "red",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [0.3, 0.5, 3], "size": [0.5, 0.5, 0.5] }]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 5, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 50 },
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "box",
                  "class": "box",
                  "colour": "red",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [0.6, 0.5, 1], "size": [1, 1, 1] }]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 5, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 50 },
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "box",
                  "class": "box",
                  "colour": "red",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [0.9, 0.5, -1], "size": [1.5, 1.5, 1.5] }]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "右边的立方体离相机 2 米。", "en": "The cube on the right is 2 m from the camera." },
              "claim": { "depth": { "object": "right", "z": 2 } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "左边的立方体是红色的。", "en": "The cube on the left is red." },
              "claim": { "colour": { "object": "left", "is": "red" } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "右边的立方体在画面里看得见。", "en": "The cube on the right shows in the picture." },
              "claim": { "visible": { "object": "right" } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "左边的立方体高 0.4 米。", "en": "The cube on the left is 0.4 m tall." },
              "claim": { "height": { "object": "left", "h": 0.4 } }
            }
          ],
          "scenes": [
            {
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 5, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 50 },
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "left",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "yellow",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [-0.9, 0.2, 2.5], "size": [0.4, 0.4, 0.4] }]
                },
                {
                  "id": "right",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "green",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [0.5, 0.6, 3], "size": [0.5, 0.5, 0.5] }]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 5, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 50 },
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "left",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "yellow",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [-0.9, 0.2, 2.5], "size": [0.4, 0.4, 0.4] }]
                },
                {
                  "id": "right",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "green",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [0.75, 0.65, 2], "size": [0.75, 0.75, 0.75] }]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 5, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 50 },
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "left",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "yellow",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [-1.8, -0.1, 0], "size": [0.8, 0.8, 0.8] }]
                },
                {
                  "id": "right",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "green",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [0.5, 0.6, 3], "size": [0.5, 0.5, 0.5] }]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "naive": {
        "picks": [
          [["supported"], ["supported"], ["supported"], ["contradicted"]],
          [["supported"], ["contradicted"], ["supported"], ["supported"]]
        ],
        "why": {
          "zh": "按箱子在图里的大小定出了一个距离：可小而近的箱子和大而远的箱子渲出同一张图，距离和高度在候选场景里各不相同。",
          "en": "That reads one distance off the box's size in the image, but a small near box and a large far one render the same picture: depth and height differ between the candidate scenes."
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
